  "description": "OEDRO's roll-up trunk tonneau cover is made of stretchable and UV-resistant double-layer PVC. The tonneau cover has a built-in powder-coated guide rail and aluminum clip for easy installation and excellent stability. Both sides of the trunk bed cover are sealed with Velcro, and the top is fixed with a tailgate latch system to make the lathe cover tight, wrinkle-proof, snow-proof, and dust-proof. The pickup tailgate lock is easy to install and can turn your truck bed into a completely safe truck.\nFeatures\nProtect your truck bed. OEDRO's roll-up soft truck bed cover provides your pickup truck with the perfect combination of safety, convenience, and appearance. With the help of the tailgate latch system and the velcro strips sealed on both sides, your truck bed instantly becomes a 100% snow, rain, UV, and dust-resistant luggage compartment.\nHeavy-duty PVC material. OEDRO's truck tonneau cover is made of double-layer PVC, which has been thoroughly tested to provide UV protection and excellent tensile properties. Includes pre-assembled powder-coated rails and aluminum clips for trouble-free installation and strong stability.\nNo need to drill. No drill clamps to fix the trunk lid rails to the floor of your truck. The installation can be completed within 20-30 minutes using a wrench and socket.\nAerodynamic profile. The tonneau cover is installed on top of your bed railing to provide maximum cargo space and waterproof performance.\n1 year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado 1500 /GMC Sierra 1500\nOnly fit for New Body Style.\nWithout Multi-Flex Tailgate.",
